Cursor-only command guidance. Project rules live in `AGENTS.md`, which Cursor
reads natively; Cursor's role and the Claude handoff protocol live in
`implementation-workflow.mdc` — do not restate either here.

Run in the sandbox: `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, `npm run check`,
`npm run format:check`, `npm test`, `git status`.

Request elevated permissions on the **first** attempt (these need network,
simulators, Watchman, or paths outside the workspace — retrying in the
sandbox just wastes a turn):

- `npm install`, `npx expo install`
- `npm run verify`, `npm run smoke:export`
- `npm run dev` / `npx expo start` — always pass an explicit `--port`
- `npm run test:e2e`, `maestro`, `adb`, simulator or emulator launches
- `npm run screenshots`, `npm run doctor`

Do not use elevated permissions for ordinary file edits, `git commit`, or
`git push`.
